= Apache OpenNLP 2.5.13 released
Apache OpenNLP
2026-11-12
:jbake-type: post
:jbake-tags: community
:jbake-status: published
:category: news
:idprefix:

The Apache OpenNLP team is pleased to announce the release of Apache OpenNLP 2.5.13.

The Apache OpenNLP library is a machine learning based toolkit for the processing of natural language text.

It supports the most common NLP tasks, such as tokenization, sentence segmentation, part-of-speech tagging, named entity extraction, chunking, parsing, and coreference resolution.

Apache OpenNLP 2.5.13 binary and source distributions are available for download from our link:/download.html[download page].

The OpenNLP library is distributed by Maven Central as well. See the link:/maven-dependency.html[Maven dependency] page for more details.

== What's new in Apache OpenNLP 2.5.13

This is a *maintenance release* on the 2.x line. It requires Java 17 and backports bug fixes and thread-safety improvements from the 3.x line.

=== Highlights

* *Thread safety*: `TokenizerME` no longer changes the shared `WhitespaceTokenizer.INSTANCE`, and `MorfologikTagDictionary`, `AbstractModel` and `AbstractClassPathModelFinder.findModels` can be shared between threads.
* *Deep learning*: `SentenceVectorsDL` runs on a GPU, `DocumentCategorizerDL` computes a numerically stable softmax, invalid document split options are rejected instead of looping forever, and `close()` can be called more than once.
* *Model downloads*: `DownloadUtil` uses a local copy of the model index when the model host cannot be reached and verifies cached models against their SHA-512 checksum.
* *Format readers and data*: the AD readers no longer hang at end of file or fail on the FlorestaVirgem corpus, the bundled Spanish head rules match tags with escaped dots, and `MarkableFileInputStream` and the Leipzig reader release their file handles.
* `BaseModel` loads on Android, and `StringUtil.toUpperCase` maps supplementary-plane letters.
* *Release artifacts*: the binary distribution LICENSE covers all bundled third-party code.

=== Notes

* `DownloadUtil` stores the model index and a `.sha512` file next to each downloaded model in the download directory. A cached model whose checksum does not match fails to load with an `IOException`.
* `DocumentCategorizerDL` and `NameFinderDL` reject a document split size below 1, a negative overlap, or an overlap not smaller than the split size with `IllegalArgumentException`.
* `MorfologikTagDictionary.clearThreadLocalState()` releases the dictionary lookup of the current thread.

=== Dependency Updates
* Apache Parent POM 40
* ClassGraph 5.0.2
* ONNX Runtime 1.31.1
* SLF4J 2.0.20
* Maven 3.10.0 via the Maven Wrapper

For further details, check the full list of changes in the link:https://github.com/apache/opennlp/releases/tag/opennlp-2.5.13[GitHub release notes,role=external,window=_blank],
the link:https://github.com/apache/opennlp/compare/opennlp-2.5.12...opennlp-2.5.13[changes since 2.5.12,role=external,window=_blank],
or the link:https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ReleaseNote.jspa?projectId=12311215&version=12357511[JIRA release notes,role=external,window=_blank].

--The Apache OpenNLP Team
